    ],
    "description": "German Hunter Style Tobacco Pipe\nMunchen Edition, Modular Construction\nWood, Metal, and Horn, Approximately 6 Inches Long\nA classic German \"Jager\" or hunter-style tobacco pipe, featuring the traditional modular multi-piece construction characteristic of Central European alpine regions. This specific piece is detailed with \"Munchen\" (Munich) engraved on the bowl, identifying it as a regional piece from the Bavarian capital. Designed for functionality in outdoor settings, these pipes feature long stems to cool the smoke and wind caps to protect the embers.\nModular design consisting of a polished wood bowl, bark-covered wooden stem section, and horn mouthpiece transition\nDecorative hinged metal wind cap with ornate perforations and a secure latch mechanism\nAccented with a traditional green cord featuring wooden toggle beads and a small decorative tassel\nEngraved \"Munchen\" banner design on the side of the bowl\nCondition:\nThe item is in used condition with visible charring and residue inside the bowl from previous use. The exterior wood finish retains a high gloss with minor surface handling marks. Metal components, including the bands and wind cap, show light tarnish and age-related patina. The modular joints fit securely. The green decorative cord is intact with some minor fraying to the tassel.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
